cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article."
title: "BisimulationMol: Journal experiments for the accepted JBCB article"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible implementation of a Petri-net framework that compares explicit
  qualitative biological network models under a declared observational
  interface using strong and weak bisimulation, simulation preorders and a
  trace-based distance. The package includes construction-ground-truth
  benchmarks, a direct 151-graphlet/592-slot PN-GDDA implementation and Holmes
  audit, an LTS graphlet comparator, asynchronous/synchronous sensitivity,
  an exhaustive simulation-game oracle, held-out HPN-DREAM validation,
  scalability measurements, a curated Arabidopsis-animal illustration and
  fixed-interface death-receptor commitment experiments.
type: software
